1.1 Unlimited Scalability
=========================

Because the system is modular and network-based, it is _completely
scalable_.  You can start with a basic home automation setup and grow
into a massive distributed network with multiple cores, each dedicated
to a specific task.  We aren't just talking about managing a house;
we’re talking about scaling to a warehouse, a farm, a neighborhood, or
even an entire city.

Before we get into the technical weeds, I want to take a moment to look
at the foundational concepts of automation.  Through this manual, my
goal is to help you see automation through an _abstract lens_.  Once you
grasp the abstraction, you’ll realize how STARTER can be adapted to
solve almost any challenge you throw at it.


