B.6.1 STStats: The Telemetry Container
--------------------------------------

The 'STStats' object acts as a snapshot of a process's performance
metrics.  It uses the 'STStatsEntry' structure to store MIN, MAX, and
LAST values for each metric.

 -- Structure: STStatsEntry
     'min'
          The minimum value recorded since the collector started.
     'max'
          The maximum value recorded.
     'last'
