B.6.2 STStatsCollector: The Abstract Engine
-------------------------------------------

The 'STStatsCollector' is a derivable base class designed to automate
the sampling of statistics at regular intervals.

 -- Function: STStatsCollector * st_stats_collector_new (STStats *STATS,
