B.6.3 STProcessStatsCollector: Process Monitoring
-------------------------------------------------

This is a specialized implementation of the collector that reads
performance data directly from the system (e.g., '/proc' on Linux) for
the current process.

 -- Function: STProcessStatsCollector * st_process_stats_collector_new
